  "title": "alp: Coverity does not like post-decrement in while loops",
  "description": "Post-decrementing upon exit of a while loop with a variable at zero,\nthus causing overflow, makes Coverity complain. It's true that in many\ncases the loop variable should be 0 at the end if it will be used\nfurther, not whatever maximum value the type can hold.\n\nCoverity CID 1604194",
